							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "{g_{t t} = (2M r-(a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2-(r)**2) ((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g_{t \\phi} = -2M a r (\\sin(\\theta))**2 ((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g_{\\phi t} = -2M a r (\\sin(\\theta))**2 ((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g_{r r} = ((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g_{\\theta \\theta} = (a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2, g_{\\phi \\phi} = -(2M (a)**2 r (\\cos(\\theta))**2-2M (a)**2 r-(a)**4 (\\cos(\\theta))**2-(a)**2 (r)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2-(a)**2 (r)**2-(r)**4) (\\sin(\\theta))**2 ((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g^{t t} = (2M (a)**2 r (\\cos(\\theta))**2-2M (a)**2 r-(a)**4 (\\cos(\\theta))**2-(a)**2 (r)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2-(a)**2 (r)**2-(r)**4) (((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2))**(-1), g^{t \\phi} = -2M a r (((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2))**(-1), g^{r r} = (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2) ((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g^{\\theta \\theta} = ((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g^{\\phi t} = -2M a r (((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2))**(-1), g^{\\phi \\phi} = (-2M r + (a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2) (((a)**2 (\\cos(\\theta))**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2) (\\sin(\\theta))**2)**(-1)}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\left[g_{t t} = \\frac{\\left(2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{t \\phi} = -\\frac{2\\,M a r {\\left(\\sin{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{\\phi t} = -\\frac{2\\,M a r {\\left(\\sin{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{r r} = \\frac{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{\\theta \\theta} = {a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{\\phi \\phi} = -\\frac{\\left(2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{4\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{r}^{4\\,}\\right) {\\left(\\sin{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{t t} = \\frac{\\left(2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{4\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{r}^{4\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{t \\phi} = -\\frac{2\\,M a r}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{r r} = \\frac{\\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{\\theta \\theta} = \\frac{1}{{a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{\\phi t} = -\\frac{2\\,M a r}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{\\phi \\phi} = \\frac{\\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\cos{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) {\\left(\\sin{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}}\\right]\\end{dmath*}"
