					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "The Kerr metric is a vacuum solution, so the Ricci tensor has to vanish. All\nof its components are indeed recognised as zero:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "The Kerr metric is a vacuum solution, so the Ricci tensor has to vanish. All\nof its components are indeed recognised as zero:"
